# TAJIRI Cursor context

## Authority (highest first)

1. User instructions in the chat  
2. Repo root `CLAUDE.md` and `docs/DESIGN.md`  
3. Files under `.cursor/skills/` (full `SKILL.md` bodies)  
4. Other project docs  

If a skill disagrees with `CLAUDE.md` or `docs/DESIGN.md`, follow the repo docs.

## Skills (ported from Claude Code)

| Area | Path |
|------|------|
| Index / triggers | `.cursor/skills/SKILLS_SUMMARY.md` |
| Social platform (feed, messages, clips, Michango, …) | `.cursor/skills/tajiri-platform/SKILL.md` |
| Flutter / Dart | `.cursor/skills/flutter-expert/SKILL.md` and `references/` |
| UI / Swahili / Material | `.cursor/skills/design-guidelines/SKILL.md` |
| Offline, Hive, sync | `.cursor/skills/mobile-offline-support/SKILL.md` |
| Session checkpoints | `.cursor/skills/session-memory/SKILL.md` |
| Long-term project memory (`--learn`) | `.cursor/skills/project-memory-store/SKILL.md` |

Read the relevant `SKILL.md` when the task matches its domain.

## Memory files

- Session: `.cursor/memory/session-state.md` (restore at session start when useful)  
- Project knowledge: `.cursor/memory/project/*.md`  

## Claude-only config

`.claude/settings.json` enabled Claude Code plugins (e.g. superpowers). Cursor does not load those; use this ruleset and the skill files above instead.
